URL: https://github.com/NixOS/patchelf/releases/download/0.19.2/patchelf-0.19.2.tar.gz c68aec3e0c9aa2b021492637944e23a36b339d9dfade6911ed5e38fd2889c546
Origname: patchelf-0.19.2
Name: patchelf

    patchelf 0.19.2 with no Fil-C changes needed. The 0.18.0 Fil-C patch
    rewrote the .shstrtab pointer to be derived as
    fileContents->data() + rdi(shdrs[shstrtabIndex].sh_offset) instead of
    round-tripping a pointer through size_t, which Fil-C cannot do
    safely; upstream 0.19.1 restructured that code to the same
    capability-safe shape (data() + shstrtabOffset), and 0.19.2 keeps
    that shape, so the patch is empty and the rebase needed no conflict
    resolution.
